            a: `There are no stacked discount bands — the ladder is the volume answer. Ordering products individually is ${euro(AMOUNT.catalog + AMOUNT.lifestyle, 'en')} per product at drop scope; a Full Drop is ${dropPerProduct} per product for the same work. The saving is in running them together, and it is on the pricing page rather than behind a negotiation.`,
          },
          {
            q: 'Is there a subscription?',
            a: `Not one you need. A drop is a one-off: one job, one invoice, no standing commitment. There is a studio retainer at ${euro(AMOUNT.retainer, 'en')} a month for brands shipping a drop every month, but it is an option, not the default.`,
          },
